# --- local configuration (machine-specific paths) ------------------------
tct.toml

# --- internal development notes -----------------------------------------
# TASKS.md tracks what is open while the work is being done. It is written and
# re-read from outside this repository (the board session assembles it), and it
# describes the work rather than being part of it -- so it stays on disk and
# out of history, where a second copy would only be a second place to go stale.
TASKS.md

